   <text>
      <body>
         <!-- Used <div> to separate both documents but include them both in the same TEI file - CRO.-->
         <div n="1" type="calendar-page">
            <head>March 11, 1909</head>
            <p>Thursday</p>
            <figure>
               <graphic url="IMG_2049.jpg"></graphic>
            </figure>
            <p>Everybody dressed in their best
               For this is an Erie Tea
               They eat too much, talk too much
               You can bet they don't refer to me.</p>
         </div>
         <div n="2" type="calendar-page">
            <head>March 12, 1909</head>
            <p>Friday</p>
            <figure>
               <graphic url="IMG_2050.jpg"></graphic>
            </figure>
            <p>Molly on snowshoes that Mr. Weir got.
               Pretty picture is it not?!</p>
         </div>
         
         <div n="3" type="calendar-page">
            <head>March 17, 1909</head>
            <p>Wednesday</p>
            <figure>
               <graphic url="IMG_2052.jpg"></graphic>
            </figure>
            <p>St. Patrick was a useful saint. 
               He frightend all the snakes away- 
               I wish he'd try his art on smoke around the Hammermill someday</p>
         </div>
         
         <note place="bottom" type="signature">
            <unclear></unclear>
         </note>
      </body>
   </text>
   
